  <item>
    <title>【毒电波/身体恐怖/东脑/牛奶袋】聊聊那些主流视野之外的“怪游戏”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65785b246396a4645a99564c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65785b246396a4645a99564c</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 13 Dec 2023 03:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>作为一名非常喜爱独特游戏的玩家，我之前体验过不少各具特色的“怪游戏”。</span></p><p><span>但说到近年来令我印象最深刻的，可能莫过于《Who's Lila（谁是莱拉）》。</span></p><p><span>今天这期节目，咱们就来和《谁是莱拉》的官中译者少狗椿老师，一起聊聊关于“怪游戏”的话题。</span></p><p><span>【Staff】</span></p><p><span>主持：</span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/765770?spm_id_from=333.1007.0.0" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/765770?spm_id_from=333.1007.0.0"><span>Boss</span></a></p><p><span>“热爱游戏与文化的独立创作者”</span></p><p><span>嘉宾：少狗椿</span></p><p><span>“为了生存货币卖社交货币的人”</span></p><p><span>【本期涉及的游戏】</span></p><p><span>工房库：噩梦历险记 </span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Ua411M7nh/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=66dededb9c38f1d4316f942c8b52ec96" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Ua411M7nh/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=66dededb9c38f1d4316f942c8b52ec96"><span>【游戏文化EP.5】潮湿阴暗的畸形秀与噩梦之旅</span></a></p><p><span>东脑 </span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV15i4y1y7cH/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=66dededb9c38f1d4316f942c8b52ec96" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV15i4y1y7cH/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=66dededb9c38f1d4316f942c8b52ec96"><span>【游戏文化EP.2】佐藤理的脑子里到底在想些啥</span></a></p><p><span>Sorry we're open</span></p><p><span>The endless empty</span></p><p><span>South Scrimshaw, Part One（骨雕南岛）</span></p><p><span>思い出して/思い出せなくて 罪</span></p><p><span>Discover My Body</span></p><p><span>莱卡星球</span></p><p><span>Growing my grandpa</span></p>]]></description>
