  <item>
    <title>【洗衣店怪谈、商场里的疯子】宇宙奇妙物语之夜 | 宇宙Radio万圣节特别节目</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6537386498b6450e1cb2334d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6537386498b6450e1cb2334d</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 27 Oct 2023 08:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><span>漫长的夜幕降临，万圣节的幽灵和鬼怪们开始在黑暗中跃然而起。</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>今晚，我们将带领你穿越时间的迷雾，探索那些潜藏在黑暗中的秘密。</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>我们将在你的耳边诉说，那些超越现实的恐怖奇闻。</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>所以，坐稳了。调高音量，准备好你的耳朵。</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>让我们一起迎接【宇宙奇妙物语之夜】。</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【Staff】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Boss &nbsp;</span></strong><span>“热爱游戏与文化的独立创作者”</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>怪狗_WeirDog &nbsp;</span></strong><span>“别忘了去Epic领恶灵附身”</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【时间线】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">0:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">3:00</a> 开场闲聊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">3:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2066">34:26</a> 第一个故事与结局1</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2066">34:26</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2471">41:11</a> 结局复盘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2471">41:11</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3840">1:04:00</a> 第二个故事与结局1</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3840">1:04:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4380">1:13:00</a> 结局复盘</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【联系我们】</span></strong><span>​</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span>如果你喜欢本期节目，或者有什么奇思妙想的小故事</span></strong></em><em><span>，可以将你的创意</span></em><em><strong><span>通过哔哩哔哩私信的形式</span></strong></em><em><span>进行投稿，或许它就</span></em><span>会成为</span><em><span>下一个故事。</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span>如有你喜欢画画，</span></strong></em><em><span>也可以大胆的画出你心目中本期最令你印象深刻的东西，在B站评论区留言分享~（节目录完后和怪狗互相试着画了画彼此分享的故事中的怪物，发现我们的理解有很大的出入，还是蛮有趣的！）</span></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>哔哩哔哩</span></strong><span> &nbsp;&nbsp;不是Boss的Boss​</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>新浪微博</span></strong><span> &nbsp;&nbsp;不是Boss的Boss</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>电子邮箱 </span></strong><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;Daydreaminblu_studio@outlook.com</span></p>]]></description>
